  "notes": [
    "Almost all player text is vanilla $tokens passed to Localization.Localize; only the mod's own English is here.",
    "texts: default fuzzy clock words (config Info - Clock/Time fuzzy words, shown via TMP_Text.SetText when Time type = Fuzzy) and the default in-world ping text passed to Localize.",
    "patterns: main-menu character stats lines \"<name>: <number>\" set on FejdStartup.m_csSourceInfo.text; covers the Kills/Crafts aliases and all 205 PlayerStatType counters in Valheim 1.0.16 (enum names split before every capital). Count/None are sentinel values absent from PlayerProfile stats. Numeric values remain opaque; no enum-name substitution or config change.",
    "Пакет текущего профиля проверен 2026-10-17 по точной установленной DLL и декомпиляции; версия пакета и BepInPlugin сверены отдельно. Игровая приёмка относится к общей квитанции выпуска."
  ]
}
